Z||000011||mblackwell||05-22-2001||06:28 PM||||What we need to do is make a US map with everyone's radius drawn on it and post it on the web somewhere.  Then all planned trips will by posted in advance so that others can add thier parts to them.  The you would need to assign tracking numbers to each part, and each member of  the distribution network would post the number on the web site as soon as they recieve the part so nothing gets lost.  As for payment, the buyer would send a check to each relay point on the planned route, there would be a fixed per mile payment.<P>Have fun running this thing, Cheever.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
