Z||000029||Cheever2||05-24-2001||02:36 PM||||The first prototype for a website has been created, and I have sent the URL to several Forum friends for opinions.<P>Meanwhile, I will still need assistance with the following:<BR>- help to reach FOLD members<BR>- help to reach Fiero clubs in the US & Canada<BR>- help to reach our brothers & sisters on the Fiero E-List<BR>- somebody to step up and invent a contest to name the project<P>Are you with me?  Follow me into a new land, a land of Fiero life expectancy only dreamed of now, a land where milk & honey... er, ah, drivetrains & bodyparts flow from horizon to horizon, where young & old, rich & poor, male & female, headbangers & boy-bands share the lifeblood that runs through us all - the NEED for Fieros.  Let's meet that need by bringing about a new era of community & togetherness with the exchange of the parts which keep us mobile.  Let's show the world that our cars truly are the best, because their <I>owners</I> are the best!  Again I say: Are you with me?<BR>||||reg||1
